        'Decide the risk in percent, set the stop loss from the chart structure, calculate the lot size and round down. Then follow the plan. Risk management does not guarantee profits, but it limits your loss on every trade. If you are just starting, also read <a href="swing-trading-incepatori.html">what swing trading is</a> and <a href="stop-loss-forex.html">how to place a stop loss correctly</a>.',
